{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LightQb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>forced</strong> to take part in an experiment\u00a0<strong>you didn't sign up for</strong>. Trapped in an unknown space, you must dash and <strong>survive</strong> through a  grid-like world filled with <strong>light</strong>\u00a0<strong>cubes</strong>, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/ef755b43832c223f0f8972456910b0cd.poster.avif?t=1771610950\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/ef755b43832c223f0f8972456910b0cd.webm?t=1771610950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is your greatest enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cubes, lasers, and portals to your advantage as you blaze through levels at incredible speeds, but <strong>beware</strong>, there might be more to this world than meets <strong>the eye</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/41f816cc497324c7fa73a2502c5d13d1.poster.avif?t=1771610950\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/41f816cc497324c7fa73a2502c5d13d1.webm?t=1771610950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play, die and repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>cycle</strong> continues until you master your path to the end or give up. Oh, and did I mention there\u2019s someone taunting you every time you <strong>die</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/a8759bfc7f69e21f240b634a3da972c8.poster.avif?t=1771610950\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/a8759bfc7f69e21f240b634a3da972c8.webm?t=1771610950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/335c78a8497f78acf62167f5eea1a356e84c1a22.jpg"},{"name":"True Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/3d68e1956d56d3991dd04a468914007f4da8ba89.jpg"},{"name":"How Bad Are You Really","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/a3ca12e4d82a1ae961547ad4a026ac9bb42dbb5c.jpg"},{"name":"Dedicated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/1155edd36aa67b5bdbcb58f17e7d480349c73c14.jpg"},{"name":"Obsessed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/e09cf406772aec91015578b91516cdce8caacd3f.jpg"},{"name":"Tuff Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/0d273603eae2e2271e31c14c6cef8b47f3a4bc24.jpg"},{"name":"We'll Get There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/9ebcbadd9e1099dea6d06d77bfc2fae7a5aaa3aa.jpg"},{"name":"Now We're Going Places","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/18be9b9a3d68d0b514308fd2226af14e43a1a8a8.jpg"},{"name":"First Egg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392840/fc6262ea